# Pin provenance and license evidence

## Goal

Make every external influence auditable before adapting implementation code.

## Required work

- Pin immutable revisions for every source in `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`.
- Hash or independently reacquire each accepted snapshot.
- Define file-level origin annotations for adapted code.
- Preserve upstream copyright and license texts where required.
- Classify protocol facts separately from copied expression.

## Acceptance criteria

- No source is labeled merely `latest`, `main`, or `master`.
- Every incorporated file has origin, revision, license, and modification notes.
- GPL and MIT obligations are represented in distribution artifacts.
- A test or script rejects an incorporated source without a provenance record.

## Evidence

- Updated `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`
- Machine-readable provenance manifest
- License-policy test
